  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fdesoroxxx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/buymeacoffee-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"请我喝咖啡\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/hKpUYx7VwS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><h1>阿尔法海姆</h1><p>阿尔法海姆是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>的分支<em>(根据您对<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fShip_of_Theseus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">忒修斯之船</a>的理解，也可以说是重写版)</em>，而Hesperus本身又是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>的分支</p><h2>相比<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>有什么优势？</h2><p>阿尔法海姆致力于实现全场景兼容，若存在根本性不兼容的情况，会通过警告提示而非直接崩溃且不提供有效信息。</p><p>相比<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>，阿尔法海姆进行了全方位优化，总体内存占用更低。</p><p>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>不同，阿尔法海姆还提升了客户端性能：将光照相关的方块更新量减少至1/27。\n为提升客户端性能，阿尔法海姆还限制了每帧执行的光照更新量。\n此外，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>会强制在每帧前执行不必要的光照更新，而阿尔法海姆移除了这一设计。</p><p>阿尔法海姆修复的原版光照问题也比<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>更多，以下是完整修复列表及来源：</p><p>已在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>中修复：</p><ul>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-3329\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-3329</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-102162\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-102162</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-116690\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-116690</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-117067\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-117067</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-117094\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-117094</a></li>\n</ul><p>阿尔法海姆新增修复：</p><ul>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-92\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-92</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-50734\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-50734</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-80966\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-80966</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-95515\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-95515</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-104532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-104532</a></li>\n<li>修复<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-249343\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-249343</a></li>\n</ul><h3>为什么不直接向<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>提交PR？</h3><p>这是个好问题，答案很简单：相比<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>，阿尔法海姆不仅是修复bug的分支，更是我对该项目的延续。\n正如历史所证，我对模组的延续从来不只是小修小补，而是从内部进行全面革新。</p><p>最初并非如此，我确实想向<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hesperus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hesperus</a>提交PR，但在完成部分工作后，发现改动规模已远超PR范畴。\n因此我决定开发阿尔法海姆，目前包含性能优化、错误修复和兼容性改进，未来还有更多计划。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fDesoroxxx%253fr%253dAlfheim%2bGitHub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e66200c-1a7c-4f0a-a12a-387bf7d7f0f6\" alt=\"BisectHosting推广横幅\"></a></p><h1>想要定制模组或支持我？</h1><p>如果您需要某个模组但缺乏开发技能或时间，可以考虑委托我开发！\n目前接受定制委托，只要您能提供素材，我很乐意根据需求打造专属模组。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fdesoroxxx%252fcommissions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">委托说明</a></p><p>您也可以通过会员订阅持续支持。\n作为答谢，您将获得专属内容访问权、WIP项目的Discord频道，甚至能体验未发布的原型作品。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fdesoroxxx%252fmembership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">会员计划</a></p><p>也可以直接<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fdesoroxxx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请我喝杯热可可</a>。</p>",
